From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:01 2001
From: Trey Moen <trey@moen.ai>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 21:00:00 -0700
Subject: cam: TEMP csiphy/csid config dumps for the SOF-freeze hunt

Static audit of the CSIPHY packet path came back clean (v1.0.3 packed
struct layout matches camerad's packing; lane_assign 0x3210 / lane_cnt 4
map to DPHY lanes correctly; the "48000000 / 6600000000" values are
openpilot's stock ABI numbers - the kernel divides settle_time by 2e8;
the DTS "qcom,csiphy-v1.0" compatible selects the v1.0 register tables;
acquire's zero csiphy_3phase gives the 2ph mission-mode table). Confirm
at runtime: dump the parsed csiphy_info fields, the programmed
lane_enable/settle_cnt/table sizes, and the CSID rx_cfg0 word
(phy_sel/lane_cfg/vc/dt) so the PHY->CSID routing is visible in one run.
REMOVE when root-caused.
---

